  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic funding to the United Nations Partnership to Promote the Rights of Persons with Disabilities (UNPRPD)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The United Nations Partnership to Promote the Rights of Persons with Disabilities (UNPRPD) provides funding and technical expertise to co-deliver programmes with other UN agencies that are inclusive. 

We also provide funding to support the implementation of the UN Disability Inclusion Strategy (UNDIS) at UN agency and UN country team level.</narrative>
  </description>
